      <activity id="d35971ac-b611-5a05-8a75-cebdd1e6133d" activityNameId="7138b2fe-f2c9-5cbb-bc47-14b02c48fb21" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Facade construction, mounted, at building</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Facade construction, mounted, at building
Production of the additional components necessary for the mounting of 1 m2 PV panel or laminate.;
UUID: c2d778ad-95a1-3dd0-b2a9-808832cb5e84
Materials and packaging for the production and estimation for metal processing. Disposal of the product after use. Energy use for the construction process must be included in data of the PV-plant.
Location: Production in CH.
Technology: Construction parts for a photovoltaic system.
Time period: Date of data investigation. Actual weight of materials updated in 2008.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Detailed analysis of materials for one product in a diploma thesis. 
Extrapolations: From one product to the whole market. Correction factor applied to correct for today average weight per m2.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c2d778ad-95a1-3dd0-b2a9-808832cb5e84.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
